He made a bet. She made history.

2
00:11:00,000 --> 00:11:06,000
Battle of the Sexes is a drama, comedy, history film directed by Valerie Faris.

3
00:16:30,000 --> 00:16:36,000
The true story of the 1973 tennis match between world number one Billie
Jean King and ex-champ and serial hustler Bobby Riggs.

4
00:22:00,000 --> 00:22:06,000
Billie Jean King, played by Emma Stone.

5
00:27:30,000 --> 00:27:36,000
Bobby Riggs, played by Steve Carell.

6
